  "task_html": "<div class='task-block task-blue'><div class='task-block-label'>Offene Aufgabe &ndash; Erkunde &amp; Erkl&auml;re</div><div style='background:#dbeafe;border:1.5px solid #93c5fd;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 16px;margin:0 0 14px;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;'><span style='font-size:20px;flex-shrink:0;'>📋</span><div style='font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;'><strong>Besonders geeignet zur Abgabe</strong><br>Notiere deinen vollst&auml;ndigen L&ouml;sungsweg auf einem Blatt Papier und gib ihn bei der Lernbegleitung ab.</div></div><div style='display:flex;justify-content:center;margin:4px 0 14px;'><svg viewBox='0 0 200 150' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' style='width:min(200px,100%);max-height:150px;'><rect x='0' y='0' width='200' height='150' rx='12' fill='#eff6ff'/><line x1='20' y1='135' x2='180' y2='15' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2' stroke-linecap='round'/><line x1='20' y1='75' x2='180' y2='75' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2' stroke-linecap='round'/><line x1='20' y1='25' x2='180' y2='125' stroke='#d97706' stroke-width='2' stroke-linecap='round'/><line x1='60' y1='15' x2='140' y2='135' stroke='#dc2626' stroke-width='2' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-dasharray='6,3'/><circle cx='100' cy='75' r='5.5' fill='#1d4ed8' stroke='white' stroke-width='2'/><text x='108' y='70' font-size='11' fill='#1d4ed8' font-weight='bold'>P(2|3)</text><text x='22' y='132' font-size='9' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='600'>f&#x2081;</text><text x='22' y='72' font-size='9' fill='#16a34a' font-weight='600'>f&#x2082;</text><text x='22' y='26' font-size='9' fill='#d97706' font-weight='600'>f&#x2083;</text><text x='62' y='18' font-size='9' fill='#dc2626' font-weight='600'>f&#x2084;</text><text x='100' y='146' text-anchor='middle' font-size='9' fill='#1d4ed8' font-style='italic'>alle durch P(2|3)</text></svg></div><p style='font-size:14px;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 10px;'>Welche linearen Funktionen gehen durch P(2|3)?</p><div style='display:grid;gap:8px;margin:0;'><div style='background:#fff;border:1px solid #bfdbfe;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;'><span style='font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#2563eb;'>a)</span><span style='font-size:14px;margin-left:6px;'>Finde mindestens <strong>4 verschiedene</strong> Gleichungen f(x) = mx + b, die durch P(2|3) gehen. W&auml;hle m&ouml;glichst verschiedene Steigungen.</span></div><div style='background:#fff;border:1px solid #bfdbfe;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;'><span style='font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#2563eb;'>b)</span><span style='font-size:14px;margin-left:6px;'>Was haben alle deine Gleichungen gemeinsam? <strong>Erkl&auml;re in eigenen Worten</strong>, warum es unendlich viele M&ouml;glichkeiten gibt.</span></div><div style='background:#fff;border:1px solid #bfdbfe;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;'><span style='font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#2563eb;'>c)</span><span style='font-size:14px;margin-left:6px;'>Zeichne zwei deiner Funktionen in ein Koordinatensystem und markiere den Punkt P(2|3).</span></div></div></div>",
